		(at 132.5 78)
		(descr "TI DN024 (SWRA227E) meandering monopole, exact copy of Table 1: 868/915/920 MHz single band, or 868 + 2440 MHz dual band. 38.0 x 25.0 mm envelope, 2.0 mm trace, on 1.6 mm FR4. Copper on both layers, tied at the plated feed hole. The note requires a pi matching network at the feed and gives its values; the antenna itself is not a 50 ohm part."
